# Generated Artifacts

- `SharedLibrary/dist` is untracked generated output; edit `src`, not `dist`.
- Wiki build/assets output belongs in tool-owned staging and is not a source of
  truth.
- The Unity Jint `app.js` artifact is owned by the sibling Moonhaven repository
  and must be rebuilt through its Scripts project.
- Verification commands must not leave generated changes in either worktree.
- Never overwrite manually maintained wiki art without an explicit apply plan
  and user approval.
